      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's perfect, that's exactly the tone I needed. One more thing though - I'm also trying to figure out why this keeps happening. It's almost like the inventory just vanishes or the paperwork gets sabotaged. Do you have any ideas on what might cause these kinds of systematic errors in a warehouse setting? Like, is it usually just human error or could there be something more... deliberate going on with the tracking?",
